    <p class="max-w-2xl text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink/60">
      How Rich Is Too Rich is a satirical entertainment game and is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
      or sponsored by any individual or company featured. Net worth figures are illustrative public
      estimates, not real-time financial data. See our <a href="/disclaimer" class="underline hover:text-pop-pink">full disclaimer</a>.
    </p>
    <nav class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-xs text-ink/60">
      <a href="/about" class="hover:text-pop-pink">About</a>
      <a href="/contact" class="hover:text-pop-pink">Contact</a>
      <a href="/privacy-policy" class="hover:text-pop-pink">Privacy Policy</a>
      <a href="/terms" class="hover:text-pop-pink">Terms of Use</a>
      <a href="/disclaimer" class="hover:text-pop-pink">Disclaimer</a>
    </nav>
